r's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"fnIkeoF_s5DKRieWjWKNiQ","review_id":"gbeqEYRKcj4dSyhp6isTEQ","date":"2015-05-14T18:30:58","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9421865344047546,"text_excerpt":"I was here both nights I was in New Orleans, so clearly it's fun. One floor of dancing with the main centerpiece being the mechanical 'bull', which costs $5 to ride. No, I did not ride and no, I did not show my boobs, but it seemed like most of the rest of the females in the bar took advantage of one or more options there. Lots of country music and dancing, and a smart bar staff. I was surprised by how expensive the drinks were compared to...everywhere else on bourbon street ($5.75 for a beer when everywhere else was $3 max), which was a downfall, but the music was awesome. This is a good place to come mid-night out (too early and you're wondering why you're watching so many breasts at 6p..."},{"business_id":"fnIkeoF_s5DKRieWjWKNiQ","review_id":"BMF1nwK7en2TWjjqyWL07Q","date":"2015-05-17T13:43:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9325084090232849,"text_excerpt":"3 for 1s were the deal on Friday! Great time, they have an upper balcony you can drink on and watch the people walking up and down bourbon. They also have a mechanical bull, which I tried for 5 bucks and had a blast on! Fun spot!"},{"business_id":"fnIkeoF_s5DKRieWjWKNiQ","review_id":"kfnFQjtJQPmtmUEs1BaEog","date":"2018-09-29T01:31:45","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9191241264343262,"text_excerpt":"Love this place. Definitely now my bar if I go back to New Orleans. Every other place blows out your ear drums with noise. Here its country but just the right volume. But I really love the mechanical Bull. I rode that bad boy 4 times. Fun to watch the ladies give it a try. The only thing this place needs is Karaoke to be totally Perfect!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"fnIkeoF_s5DKRieWjWKNiQ","photo_id":"pWSZFZI8jNQ_bp_f5r2TPg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/pWSZFZI8jNQ_bp_f5r2TPg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.87464839220047},{"business_id":"fnIkeoF_s5DKRieWjWKNiQ","photo_id":"VxHDhAS8dzutG0RD73uXHA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/VxHDhAS8dzutG0RD73uXHA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8616687059402466},{"business_id":"fnIkeoF_s5DKRieWjWKNiQ","photo_id":"0oMhlPSkqoBq89rWcCDMzA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/0oMhlPSkqoBq89rWcCDMzA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8484565615653992},{"business_id":"fnIkeoF_s5DKRieWjWKNiQ","photo_id":"BLD1v0U1ImLLCQI3p--_uQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/BLD1v0U1ImLLCQI3p--_uQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8415130376815796},{"business_id":"fnIkeoF_s5DKRieWjWKNiQ","photo_id":"SxxwvNY0TP4Ulletf6KR2g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/SxxwvNY0TP4Ulletf6KR2g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.820787250995636}]},"notebook_case":null}
